{"title":"Blizzard's Bane","slug":"Blizzard's_Bane","pageid":4751,"revid":20824,"timestamp":"2025-12-19T16:56:58Z","lastEditor":"Khordie","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Pickaxe","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Icelands"},{"label":"Swing Power","value":"1.5"},{"label":"Swing Distance","value":"20 studs"},{"label":"Swing Time","value":"2"},{"label":"AOE Distance","value":"5 studs"},{"label":"Pickaxe Power","value":"2"},{"label":"Price","value":"~$349,653 (Flamethrower + Fusion Coil)"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"?"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"obtaining","text":"Obtaining"},{"id":"frozen-statue-locations-1-6","text":"Frozen Statue Locations (1-6)"},{"id":"observatory-statue-7","text":"Observatory Statue (7)"},{"id":"cave-statue-8","text":"Cave Statue (8)"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote><p><i><big>\"Thawed from the depths of the ice caves, this pickaxe pulses with eternal frost. Anything it touches turns to ice.\"</big></i></p></blockquote>\n\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Image of Blizzard's Bane\">Image of Blizzard's Bane</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Image of Blizzard's Bane </p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The <b>Blizzard's Bane</b> is a powerful pickaxe that can be obtained through warming all of the pig statues in the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Icelands/\">Icelands</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Snowy_Peaks/\">Snowy Peaks</a>. When it hits an ore, all of the unbroken pieces have the regular cracked texture + a layer of ice around them. (This ice does not appear to change how difficult the ore is to break.)\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"obtaining\">Obtaining</h2>\n<p>First, obtain the following items:\n</p>\n<ol><li><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Burning_Blossom/\">Burning Blossom</a>/<a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Meteor_Core/\">Meteor core</a> x 8</li>\n<li><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lab_Card/\">Lab Card</a> Does not consume</li>\n<li><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flamethrower/\">Flamethrower</a> Does not consume</li>\n<li><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Fusion_Coil/\">Fusion Coil</a> Does not consume(For mobile use)</li></ol>\n<p>Things to keep in mind before doing this:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Disconnecting will reset your progress and lose any items placed in the statues; make sure you have enough time to do everything.</li>\n<li>The statues don't have to be activated in any particular order, the numbered order is the most convenient when starting from spawn.</li></ul><p>\nGo to the first <b>six locations</b> on the map and use the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flamethrower/\">Flamethrower</a> to melt the ice for each pig statue.  <i>Don't leave them before activating them with the blossoms or cores!</i> Placing a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Burning_Blossom/\">Burning Blossom</a> or <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Meteor_Core/\">Meteor Core</a> into each one and the <b>seventh in the Observatory</b> and <b>eighth in the ice cave</b>, you should see an orange glow in each statue. (Drag the object into them)</p><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Map of frozen statues in the second floor of\">Map of frozen statues in the second floor of</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Map of frozen statues in the second floor of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gizmo's_Observatory/\">Gizmo's Observatory</a></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Frozen statue\">Frozen statue</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Frozen statue</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2 id=\"frozen-statue-locations-1-6\">Frozen Statue Locations (1-6)</h2>\n<p>Remember to melt + place a <b>Burning Blossom</b> or <b>Meteor Core</b> in each statue.\n</p>\n<ol><li><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: This one is underneath the waterfall\">This one is underneath the waterfall</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: This one is underneath the waterfall\">This one is underneath the waterfall</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p><i>This one is underneath the waterfall</i></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar2\">Altar2</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar2\">Altar2</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Enter through here\">Enter through here</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Enter through here\">Enter through here</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p><i>Enter through here. At the top of the image is Station A</i></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: This one is located underwater\">This one is located underwater</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: This one is located underwater\">This one is located underwater</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p><i>This one is located underwater</i></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar4Map\">Altar4Map</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar4Map\">Altar4Map</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar5\">Altar5</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar5\">Altar5</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: This is located higher up on the way to the Observatory.\">This is located higher up on the way to the Observatory.</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: This is located higher up on the way to the Observatory.\">This is located higher up on the way to the Observatory.</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p><i>This is located higher up on the way to the Observatory.</i></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li></ol>\n<h2 id=\"observatory-statue-7\">Observatory Statue (7)</h2><p>\nPlace a <b>Burning Blossom</b> or <b>Meteor Core</b> into the statue in Gizmo's Observatory.</p><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar7.png\">Altar7.png</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar7.png\">Altar7.png</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gizmo's_Observatory/\">Gizmo's Observatory</a></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>Use the <b>Lab Card</b> to open the door to the second floor.</p><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Use lab card\">Use lab card</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Use lab card\">Use lab card</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar7Look\">Altar7Look</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar7Look\">Altar7Look</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2 id=\"cave-statue-8\">Cave Statue (8)</h2>\n<p>Go to the final location, using the <b>Flamethrower</b> if needed to enter the caves. Walk down until the floor is <b>solid ice</b>, and there should be a drop to an area of <b>transparent ice</b>. (It'll be next to a stone path to the <b>Void</b>). Melt the ice above the huge ice block to open the entrance, and place <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Burning_Blossom/\">Burning Blossom</a> into the last statue.\n</p>\n<ol><li>Closest entry to the cave system.<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Closest entry\">Closest entry</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Closest entry\">Closest entry</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li>Go until you see the icy area with the dark rocks on the ceiling. Burn the ice above connected to the dark rocks. (Run up the sloped rocks with the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Fusion_Coil/\">Fusion Coil</a> until you can use the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flamethrower/\">Flamethrower</a> for the ice, then jump down once the rock falls.)<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: GoAltar8\">GoAltar8</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: GoAltar8\">GoAltar8</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li>There should be 7 fires already active. Place a <b>Burning Blossom</b> or <b>Meteor Core</b> in the final statue before the ice, and grab the <b>Blizzard's Bane</b> from the pedestal after the ice melts.<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: After activating 7, standing on the final statue needed to melt the ice.\">After activating 7, standing on the final statue needed to melt the ice.</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: After activating 7, standing on the final statue needed to melt the ice.\">After activating 7, standing on the final statue needed to melt the ice.</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>After activating 7, standing on the final statue needed to melt the ice.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: After activating all 8, the Blizzard's Bane spawns and can be stored.\">After activating all 8, the Blizzard's Bane spawns and can be stored.</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: After activating all 8, the Blizzard's Bane spawns and can be stored.\">After activating all 8, the Blizzard's Bane spawns and can be stored.</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>After activating all 8, the Blizzard's Bane spawns and can be stored.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li></ol>\n\n</div>"}
